<html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><style>
body{font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:#111827;line-height:1.7;max-width:860px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 28px}
h1{font-size:22pt;color:#111827;border-bottom:3px solid #c5a028;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:4px}
h2{font-size:14pt;color:#111827;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:4px;border-left:4px solid #4fd1c5;padding-left:12px;background:#f4fdfc}
h3{font-size:12pt;color:#374151;margin:16px 0 4px;font-weight:bold}
p{margin:4px 0 10px}
.meta{background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:10pt}
.meta p{margin:3px 0}
.meta strong{color:#b7881c}
.sec{border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;margin-top:28px;padding-top:16px}
.badge{display:inline-block;background:#ecfdf5;color:#065f46;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px}
.card{background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 16px;margin:10px 0}
.card-title{font-weight:bold;font-size:11.5pt;color:#111827;margin:0 0 4px}
.card-sub{font-size:10pt;color:#6b7280;margin:0 0 4px;font-style:italic}
.card-desc{color:#374151;margin:0;font-size:10.5pt}
.step{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;padding:12px 14px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;margin:8px 0}
.step-num{font-size:18pt;font-weight:bold;color:#c5a028;min-width:40px;line-height:1}
.step-body .step-title{font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;color:#111827;margin:0 0 3px}
.step-body .step-desc{font-size:10.5pt;color:#374151;margin:0}
.faq{border-left:3px solid #4fd1c5;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0}
.faq-q{font-weight:bold;color:#111827;margin:0 0 5px}
.faq-a{color:#374151;margin:0;font-size:10.5pt}
.cta{background:#111827;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 24px;margin-top:28px}
.cta h2{color:#4fd1c5;border:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 8px;background:transparent;font-size:15pt}
.cta p{color:#d1d5db;margin:4px 0}
.cta .btn{display:inline-block;background:#4fd1c5;color:#111827;font-weight:bold;padding:7px 16px;border-radius:5px;margin-top:8px;font-size:10pt}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:10.5pt}
td{padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb}
td:first-child{color:#6b7280}
td:last-child{font-weight:bold;color:#111827;text-align:right}
ul{padding-left:18px}
ul li{padding:2px 0;color:#374151}
</style></head><body><h1>Purchase A New Home</h1><div class="meta"><p><strong>Page Title:</strong> The Strategy Session</p><p><strong>Meta Description:</strong> Planning to purchase a new home in Wisconsin? Get expert mortgage advice, fast pre-approvals, and local market insights from Rob Miller. Licensed in 11 states. Call 608-227-2002.</p></div><div class="sec"><div class="badge">Home Purchase Experts</div><br><h2>Purchase Your New Home in Wisconsin</h2><p>The Madison real estate market moves fast — you need a lender who moves faster. From your first pre-approval letter to the final keys at the closing table, Rob Miller provides the local expertise and high-speed service you need to win your dream home.</p><p><strong>CTA Button:</strong> Get Pre-Approved to Shop</p></div><div class="sec"><h2>Process Roadmap</h2><div class="step"><div class="step-num">01</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">The Strategy Session</p><p class="step-desc">Before visiting any open houses, we sit down (or hop on a call) to run numbers and define target payments.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">02</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Verified Pre-Approval</p><p class="step-desc">We perform a comprehensive review of credit, income, and assets. This makes your offer as strong as cash.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">03</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">The Property Search</p><p class="step-desc">Shop with confidence knowing your exact loan eligibility and maximum purchase price limits.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">04</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Offer & Negotiation</p><p class="step-desc">Your agent submits your offer with our fast pre-approval letter attached to demonstrate buying power.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">05</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Appraisal & Processing</p><p class="step-desc">Once under contract, we order a local appraisal and verify all property details quickly.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">06</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Closing Day</p><p class="step-desc">Sign final documents, pay your down payment and closing costs, and receive the keys to your new home.</p></div></div></div><div class="sec"><h2>Main Page Content</h2><h3>Your Path to a New Home starts here</h3><h3>The Power of Local Expertise</h3><h3>Your Home Purchase Roadmap</h3><h4>Purchase Quick Facts</h4><p>Buying a home is more than a transaction; it's a milestone. Whether you're upgrading to a larger space, downsizing for retirement, or relocating to the beautiful Madison area, the mortgage you choose will impact your financial health for years to come.</p><p>At MadCity Home Loans, we don't just "process loans." We partner with you to understand your long-term goals, provide transparent options, and ensure you have the strongest possible offer in a competitive market.</p><p>Ready to start shopping? Don't wait until you find the perfect house to find the perfect loan. Get your pre-approval in place today and be ready to move when the right opportunity strikes.</p></div><div class="sec"><h2>Purchase Quick Facts</h2><table><tr><td>Pre-Approval Time</td><td>24-48 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Min Down Payment</td><td>0% - 3.5%</td></tr><tr><td>Typical Closing</td><td>30-45 Days</td></tr><tr><td>Local Focus</td><td>Madison & WI</td></tr><tr><td>Loan Limit</td><td>Up to $3M+</td></tr><tr><td>Direct Access</td><td>Yes</td></tr></table></div><div class="sec"><h2>Home Purchase FAQs — Wisconsin</h2><div class="faq"><p class="faq-q">Q: Why should I get pre-approved before looking at homes?</p><p class="faq-a">A: In a competitive market like Madison, a pre-approval is essential. It shows sellers you are a serious buyer with the financial backing to close the deal. It also gives you a clear understanding of your budget, so you don't waste time looking at homes outside your price range.</p></div><div class="faq"><p class="faq-q">Q: How much money do I really need for a down payment?</p><p class="faq-a">A: While 20% is the traditional benchmark to avoid PMI, many programs allow much less. FHA starts at 3.5%, conventional for first-time buyers at 3%, and VA/USDA offer 0% down options. Rob Miller will help you calculate the total "cash to close" required for your specific situation.</p></div><div class="faq"><p class="faq-q">Q: What are closing costs and how much are they?</p><p class="faq-a">A: Closing costs are fees paid at the end of the real estate transaction. They typically range from 2% to 5% of the purchase price and include things like appraisal fees, title insurance, loan origination fees, and government recording fees.</p></div><div class="faq"><p class="faq-q">Q: How long does the home purchase process take?</p><p class="faq-a">A: Once you are under contract, the mortgage process typically takes 30 to 45 days. However, the initial pre-approval can happen in as little as 24-48 hours. The total time depends on how quickly you find the right home and the length of the inspection period.</p></div><div class="faq"><p class="faq-q">Q: Can I buy a home if I have a lot of student loan debt?</p><p class="faq-a">A: Yes! Lenders look at your Debt-to-Income (DTI) ratio, not just the total amount of debt. Many programs have flexible guidelines for student loans. Rob Miller specializes in finding paths to homeownership for borrowers with complex financial profiles.</p></div></div><div class="cta"><h2>Found a Home You Love? Let</h2><p>Rob Miller</p><span class="btn">Start My Pre-Approval Now</span></div></body></html>